        {
            "title": "Fallalypse Universe Unites",
            "date": "2019-06-24 15:38:41",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/2415533798147221025",
            "content": "[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/33900554/2ef560938d160abfcce8f866867bec92e6078187.jpg[/img]\r\n\r\nWe decided to conduct a small experiment by combining two games from the same [b]Fallalypse Universe[/b]. Now players who buy [url=store.steampowered.com/app/1051630]Memorial Park[/url] and [url=store.steampowered.com/app/978610]Disconnect[/url] when traveling around the world of Disconnect may come across the cemetery with their grave created in Memorial Park. \r\n\r\nIt seems to us that this introduces some interesting and unusual context into [url=store.steampowered.com/app/978610]Disconnect[/url] and in general into [b]the game Universe of Fallalypse[/b]. So in this destroyed world there's a random chance that you can get to the old graveyard with the grave created by you in [url=store.steampowered.com/app/1051630]Memorial Park[/url].\r\n\r\n[h1]To sum up:[/h1]\r\n\r\n1.[i] Buy both games:[/i]\r\n[list]\r\n[*] https://store.steampowered.com/app/978610\r\n[*] https://store.steampowered.com/app/1051630\r\n[/list]\r\n2. [i]Travel across the game world of [url=store.steampowered.com/app/978610]Disconnect[/url]. And you can randomly find a graveyard location. There you can gather resources and visit your own grave from [url=store.steampowered.com/app/1051630]Memorial Park[/url].[/i]https://store.steampowered.com/app/978610\r\n\r\n"
        },
